  "releaseNotes": "# Release notes\n## v9.0.0\n- Removed deprecated target frameworks: .net Framework (all), .net Core (5.0 and earlier).\n- Refactored base NuGet package into a multi-assembly NuGet package to simplify trimming support.\n## v8.3.1\n- Disabled trimming.\n## v8.3.0\n- Removed .net Framework versions (v4.x) from target frameworks.\n## v8.2.0\n- Added support for .net 10.\n## v8.1.0\n- Added ILocalizationCultureSwitcher.SuppressEvents to set the culture without raising events, i.e. for application startup scenarios.\n## v8.0.0\n- Compatibility release\n## v7.6.0\n- Initial Release",
